~
15 ag 0 0 0 0
1000 5 -1 0 0 0 0 0
500 0 0 40 40
M
8
E
tall christmas tree pine~
Seemingly from out of nowhere, a VERY tall pine tree suddenly grew here!
You stare in awe at the beauty of the decorations gracing its branches.
There are ornaments that look just like bubbles which never pop, glowing
and swirling in light given off from within each one.  Each branch is
adorned with sparkling icicles hanging down which appear to be just a
little bit wet, but they never drip or melt.  The tree is encircled with
a garland of strung dewdrops which have captured the subtle light of
moonbeams on the night of a full moon.  The entire tree is touched by a
thin layer of glittering frost which appears to dance in the light given
off by the ornaments.  As you look upwards you see bright star light at
the very top of the tree which illuminates the whole room.
~
E
ornament bubble light~
You reach out to touch one of the ornaments and are surprised at its
delicacy.  It seemingly floats there in front of your eyes.  As your hand
gets closer, a glowing tendril of light extends towards you, leaving a
slight tingling sensation in your fingertips.
~
E
ice icicle~
Each icicle looks and feels wet and cold to the touch.  You wonder why
they don't just melt away.  It must be magic!
~
E
garland dew dewdrops~
This is really amazing!  How in the world did someone manage to string
dewdrops into such a delicate garland?  You can't even see the string!
The drops don't evaporate, drip, or run together, but they feel wet to
the touch.  As you pull your fingers away, you realize you are completely
dry!
~
E
star light~
At the pinnacle of the tree you see starlight from the heavens dancing
just above the very top branch.  How in the world did it fall from the
sky to rest here?
~
