7
E
hero~
   To all who would be Heroes.  The Hero quest is now the domain of S & M Inc.
If your profession be Bard, Ranger, Mage, Cleric, Monk or Druid you must seek Manok in
order to have your mettle tested.  If you are a Warrior, Barbarian, Paladin,
Anti-paladin or Thief then you must seek Sturm.  No part of your test may be
discussed with anyone.  Any who break this rule will be dealt with swiftly and
severely.  Multis are also required to take the test.  The first attempt is
free, subsequent attempts are 500k and a suitable waiting period.  There is
only one piece of information we, in our mercy, will divulge.  Be prepared.  
And be afraid.  Be very afraid.    

- S & M Inc. Productions
~
